        <div class="meta-row"><div class="meta-key">Goal</div><div>Block automated bulk access while preserving near-frictionless access for researchers.</div></div>
      </aside>
    </header>

    <section class="metrics-grid" aria-label="Key metrics">
      <div class="metric primary"><div class="metric-value">85%</div><div class="metric-label">reduction in unauthorized bulk scraping attempts</div><div class="metric-note">Observed within the first 6 months after deployment.</div></div>
      <div class="metric secondary"><div class="metric-value">99.97%</div><div class="metric-label">uptime maintained during 10× bot surge events</div><div class="metric-note">Availability preserved even under DDoS-level request pressure.</div></div>
