      <div class="metric"><div class="metric-value">&lt;2s</div><div class="metric-label">typical human verification latency</div></div>
    </section>

    <section class="main">
      <article class="panel landscape">
        <div class="panel-kicker">Threat Landscape</div>
        <h2>Academic content is a high-value automation target.</h2>
