            <div class="legend-item"><span class="swatch gray"></span><span>Human traffic must remain fast, accessible, and institution-friendly.</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="panel outcomes">
        <div class="panel-kicker">Outcomes</div>
        <h2>Mitigation shifts load away from the origin.</h2>
        <p>Edge verification reduces abusive request volume before it reaches publisher infrastructure, improving both security posture and service availability.</p>
